====== Deciso DEC740/DEC750/DEC2750 ======

{{page>meta:infobox:noheader&nofooter&noeditbtn}}

Deciso's DEC740 / DEC750 / DEC2750 devices are being delivered with OPNsense but as they are x86 based SoC devices they run very nicely with OpenWrt. The CPU is a quite powerful AMD SoC with a low power consumption.
It has 3 dedicated Intel I210 1G Ports and 2 times 10G from the AMD SoC. OpenWrt prior 22.03 also works with this device but does not have 10G support. DEC2750 is the same as DEC750 but comes in Rack enclosure.
Here's a [[https://wiki.junicast.de/en/junicast/review/opnsense_dec740|review]].


{{media:deciso:dec740_freigestellt.png?400|DEC740}}


